# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Env files — never commit. Use .env.example as the template. Even though the
# app's VITE_* vars are public-by-design, a tracked .env is a trap for a future
# maintainer adding a real secret.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

